      "message": "ESPN PASSES PRIORITY WITH THE STACK PRIMED! Solitude&#39;s trigger awaits resolution, set to banish the riddler and shift the life totals. Tension builds as the ethereal force prepares to fade&mdash;brilliant maneuvering! THE ARENA HOLDS ITS BREATH!",
