      "message": "AND HERE COMES THE HEADLINER ON TURN 5&mdash;ESPN UNLEASHES SUPERIOR SPIDER-MAN FOR {2}{U}{B}, SWINGING THE WEB OF DESTINY! Copying the ethereal Solitude from the graveyard, entering as a 4/4 flying powerhouse that exiles the opponent&#39;s Emperor of Bones on arrival! REMOVAL AND REINFORCEMENT IN ONE SWOOP&mdash;THE CROWD EXPLODES AS THE SPIRIT SPINS ITS WEB OF EXILE! WHAT A BOMBSHELL PLAY!",
