      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Grok4F ESPN passed on casting Goryo's Vengeance to reanimate Atraxa, Grand Unifier from the graveyard during combat. With the opponent at 15 life, no blockers, and all lands tapped, Atraxa would attack as a 7/7 flying haste lifelinker for 7 damage (opponent to 8), gain 7 life, and trigger ETB to draw up to 8 cards across card types. Additionally, Ephemerate in hand could blink Atraxa to remove the 'exile at end step' clause, keeping Atraxa permanently and triggering another ETB. This is the deck's signature combo line.",
      "action_taken": "Passed without casting any spells during combat.",
