    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Fatal Push cannot destroy Quantum Riddler because it has mana value 5, which exceeds both the base threshold (2 or less) and the revolt threshold (4 or less). Even if revolt were active (no permanent left the battlefield this turn), 5 > 4. This wastes a removal spell on an illegal/ineffective target. The card should have been saved or Bitter Triumph should have been used instead if removing Quantum Riddler was important.",
