      "player": "Llama4 Johnny",
      "decision_index": 95,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Fatal Push cannot destroy Quantum Riddler (mana value 5) even with Revolt (which only raises the threshold to 4). The Fatal Push on the stack will resolve and do nothing. Meanwhile, Bitter Triumph could actually destroy Quantum Riddler by discarding a card.",
