    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Unearth on Psychic Frog is a weak play here. The opponent has a 4/6 Quantum Riddler on board and all their lands are tapped. Bitter Triumph can destroy the Quantum Riddler right now while the opponent is tapped out and unable to respond with countermagic. Psychic Frog as a 1/2 doesn't meaningfully pressure through a 4/6 flyer, and Llama4 Johnny would need to discard cards to pump it or give it flying. Meanwhile, the Quantum Riddler is a significant threat that draws extra cards when the opponent is low on hand size. Using Bitter Triumph now (discarding Archon of Cruelty, which can later be reanimated or is otherwise hard to cast) to kill the Riddler while the opponent is tapped out is a much stronger line.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Unearth targeting Psychic Frog",
      "better_line": "Cast Bitter Triumph targeting Quantum Riddler (discarding Archon of Cruelty as additional cost) to remove the opponent's main threat while they're tapped out and can't counter it.",
      "type": "blunder",
