    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Pumping Psychic Frog during combat when the opponent's 4/6 flyer Quantum Riddler is a major threat that should be removed immediately with Bitter Triumph while the opponent is fully tapped out. While pumping Frog first is possible before also casting Bitter Triumph, the priority should be ensuring the removal resolves against the tapped-out opponent.",
