    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Copied Solitude with Superior Spider-Man instead of Archon of Cruelty from opponent's graveyard. Solitude's exile trigger gives the opponent life equal to Emperor of Bones' power, while Archon's ETB forces opponent to sacrifice a creature (removing Emperor anyway), discard a card, lose 3 life, AND draws you a card and gains you 3 life. With Ephemerate in hand for a second ETB trigger, Archon is dramatically better.",
