      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Chose Archon of Cruelty over Atraxa, Grand Unifier for Superior Spider-Man's copy ability. While Archon provides excellent immediate tempo (removing Emperor of Bones, forcing a discard, 6-life swing), Atraxa's ETB typically draws 3-5 cards from the top 10 and provides a 4/4 with flying, vigilance, deathtouch, and lifelink - likely generating more total value in a position where Grok4F ESPN is already ahead on life and board.",
      "action_taken": "Copied Archon of Cruelty from opponent's graveyard",
